#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:11891
msgid "`cir.vec.cmp` (::cir::VecCmpOp)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:11893
msgid "_Compare two vectors_"
msgstr ""

